    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Midnight Horror School",
        "jpn": "ミッドナイトホラースクール"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The school has 26 students, 3 teachers, 3 classrooms, a library, a cafeteria, a music room, a playroom, a fountain, a skeleton playground, a graveyard and several school staff. The cube-shaped students' names all start with a letter of the alphabet, which they all have on their shirt. They are all also assigned a color.",
        "jpn": "学校には生徒26人、教師3人、教室3つ、図書館、カフェテリア、音楽室、プレイルーム、噴水、骸骨の遊び場、墓地、そして数名の職員がいます。立方体の生徒たちの名前はすべてアルファベットの文字で始まり、シャツにもその文字が書かれています。また、色も決まっています。"
    },
